# Architecture North Star (v1)

These rules are mandatory for all code in this repository.

## Runtime & structure
- This project is a **single NestJS application** (one `src/main.ts` entrypoint).
- We are building a **modular monolith**:
  - One codebase
  - One database
  - Clear internal module boundaries
- Business logic lives in bounded-context modules under `src/modules/*`.
- API layers and workers are adapters/orchestration only:
  - `src/api/*` (GraphQL + ActivityPub HTTP)
  - `src/workers/*` (background job runner + handlers)

## API surfaces
- The **product API is GraphQL-first**.
- There are **two separate GraphQL endpoints**:
  - Public API (for PWA/mobile clients)
  - Admin API (for ops/moderation/admin)
- Avoid designing a RESTful product API.
- **ActivityPub + WebFinger are implemented as HTTP endpoints** under `src/api/federation-edge/*`.

## CQRS-inspired application structure
- GraphQL **Queries are reads** (no side effects).
- GraphQL **Mutations are commands** (single responsibility).
- Resolvers/controllers must be thin adapters calling command/query handlers.

## Idempotency
- State-changing mutations MUST accept an `idempotencyKey`.
- The server MUST enforce idempotency scoped by:
  - actor/user
  - mutation name
  - idempotency key
- Reusing the same `idempotencyKey` with a different payload must return a conflict-style error.

## Data & ORM
- Use **Postgres + Prisma**.
- No module may write to another module’s tables except through exported ports/use-cases.
- Never access another module’s persistence layer directly.

## Async work (v1)
- Do NOT introduce RabbitMQ/Kafka/NATS in v1 unless explicitly requested.
- Async work is implemented via a **Postgres-backed jobs table + worker runner** (`src/workers/*`).
- Any work involving external network calls (e.g., ActivityPub delivery, blockchain indexing) must run as a job.

## Caching (v1)
- Do NOT introduce Redis or other caching systems in v1 unless explicitly requested.

## If uncertain
- Propose up to 2 alternatives and pick the one most aligned with this file.
